-- ZEY - BUBBLE GUM GUI (merged: farm + auto enchant)
-- LocalScript / executor script.
--
-- Two tabs:
--   FARM
--     * Auto Bubble  - fires BlowBubble in a loop
--     * Auto Hatch   - tweens to the chosen egg (if out of range), fires HatchEgg
--                      and spams E and R
--     * Egg dropdown  - real eggs from Workspace.Rendered.Generic
--     * Rift dropdown - live rift eggs from Workspace.Rendered.Rifts, with luck shown
--   ENCHANT
--     * Dropdown of your equipped pets with their enchants
--     * "Wanted enchants" picker (scanned list, click to pick). Leveled enchants (bubbler, gleaming,
--       team up, looter) are listed per level, e.g. "team-up 5". The slot holding a wanted enchant
--       is kept, the rest is rerolled with UseShadowCrystal until the pet has everything it wants
--     * Pets holding a SPECIAL enchant (super-xl-plus, super-luck, anything "super-")
--       are never rolled, they get skipped
--     * Manual LOCK button per slot, Auto Enchant toggle, All Equipped Pets toggle
--   FARM extras: real-time clock + script uptime, Auto Claim Rewards (playtime 1-9 every 30s).
--   Tab panels scroll (small wheel steps) instead of growing the window.
--
-- Retro (Win98-style) bubble gum look: bevelled buttons, pixel font, LED toggles,
-- drifting bubbles, pixel sparkles, CRT scan bar. Draggable, close button.

